# Story 14.1: Document how to point the suite at an existing dataset

Status: Draft

## Story
As an operator, I want the README to tell me what the suite does to the dataset I point it
at, so that I do not aim it at something I care about.

## Acceptance Criteria
- AC-1 (P0): Given the README, when an operator reads it, then it states what the suite does
  to DATASET_ID.

## Tasks / Subtasks
- [ ] document the no-condition form's effect on the dataset (AC: 1)
